      "end_seconds": 78.67,
      "duration_seconds": 30.15,
      "text": "actually, um, it happens every other day. I notice it more with touching the face. Okay, so and there's being afraid to eat as well, ten days now. Oh, and pain lasting seconds. Had that since yesterday. I mean, with pain lasting seconds, it happens all the time"
